" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"449.0\" y1=\"79.6\" x2=\"449.0\" y2=\"149.5\" stroke=\"#f08488\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"441.9\" y=\"96.5\" width=\"14.3\" height=\"40.3\" fill=\"#e5484d\" stroke=\"#f08488\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"475.0\" y1=\"79.2\" x2=\"475.0\" y2=\"139.9\" stroke=\"#4fe3ac\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"467.9\" y=\"95.3\" width=\"14.3\" height=\"41.5\" fill=\"#03c988\" stroke=\"#4fe3ac\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"501.0\" y1=\"76.8\" x2=\"501.0\" y2=\"101.7\" stroke=\"#4fe3ac\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"493.9\" y=\"80.1\" width=\"14.3\" height=\"15.2\" fill=\"#03c988\" stroke=\"#4fe3ac\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"527.0\" y1=\"52.3\" x2=\"527.0\" y2=\"84.6\" stroke=\"#4fe3ac\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"519.9\" y=\"67.8\" width=\"14.3\" height=\"12.2\" fill=\"#03c988\" stroke=\"#4fe3ac\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"72.0\" y=\"147.5\" width=\"104.0\" height=\"97.9\" fill=\"#00adb5\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#00adb5\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/><text x=\"124.0\" y=\"139.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#00adb5\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\">accumulation</text><circle cx=\"345.0\" cy=\"125.8\" r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f5c542\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"345.0\" y=\"101.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f5c542\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\">sweep</text><line x1=\"449.0\" y1=\"181.5\" x2=\"449.0\" y2=\"155.5\" stroke=\"#f5c542\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#chartArrowHead)\"/><text x=\"449.0\" y=\"197.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f5c542\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"bold\">move</text><defs><marker id=\"chartArrowHead\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"4\" refY=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L4,7 L8,0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f5c542\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/></marker></defs></svg><p style=\"text-align:center; color:#8b93a0; font-size:12px; margin-top:10px; font-family:monospace;\">Where is the liquidity, and what is the path to reach it</p></div><p>Before moving to the next chapter, practice asking this one question on any chart, for any instrument: where is the liquidity, and what's the path of least resistance to reach it? You won't have the full vocabulary to answer it precisely yet \u2014 that comes over the next several chapters \u2014 but building the habit of asking it now will make everything that follows land much faster.</p>"
