        "descHtml": "<p>Practice comparing wick length to body length as a ratio, not an absolute size \u2014 a small wick on a small-bodied candle can still represent meaningful rejection relative to that period's overall range, while a large wick on an unusually large-ranged candle might just be normal volatility.</p>"
