        "desc": "Take the exact same candle shape \u2014 a long-wicked rejection candle, for instance \u2014 and find two examples: one at a level with real structural and psychological significance, and one in the middle of nowhere. Notice how di",
        "descHtml": "<p>Take the exact same candle shape \u2014 a long-wicked rejection candle, for instance \u2014 and find two examples: one at a level with real structural and psychological significance, and one in the middle of nowhere. Notice how differently you'd weight the same shape depending entirely on where it occurred.</p>"
