        "descHtml": "<p>Review your last several journal entries (from the discipline chapter earlier in this curriculum) and add a note to each one: what did the candle behavior at your entry level actually look like? This retroactive review often reveals patterns in what you're naturally drawn to trade, for better or worse.</p>"
