        "descHtml": "<p>Track a handful of order blocks forward in time on a chart you're already familiar with. Note the first time price returns to each one, and observe how the reaction on that first test compares to what happens on a second test later \u2014 the pattern of diminishing reliability becomes visible quickly.</p>"
