        "descHtml": "<p>Journal your next ten order block trades with the checklist explicitly noted for each one \u2014 which conditions were satisfied, whether the block was mitigated or fresh. Review after ten trades whether the setups scoring higher on the checklist actually performed better, using your own real data rather than assumption.</p>"
