      "Concepts only become real once you've watched them play out, repeatedly, on the specific instruments you intend to trade. This chapter takes everything from the last several chapters and applies it directly to gold (XAUUSD) and major indices (NAS100, US30), two of the most popular instruments among ICT-style traders.",
