      "Rather than introducing new theory, this chapter is built almost entirely around worked chart examples, so you can see the exact same core concepts expressed slightly differently across instruments. Spend real time on whichever instrument you actually intend to trade \u2014 the calibration this chapter is building only develops through repeated exposure to that specific instrument's typical behavior, not through reading about it once."
