      "The workflow only becomes reliable through repetition until it's the default way you open a chart, not a checklist you consciously work through. Practice the exact sequence \u2014 direction, then zone, then entry \u2014 on real charts, every single session, until reaching for the higher timeframe first happens automatically, before you've even consciously decided to do it."
